# Cause (not this change): the test adds a team task execution "retained-task" and writes its context files under agent_teams/<team>/retained-task/context_files (the layout before 20261017_task_agent_own_run_v1). Since own-run (on the base), a task agent's context files resolve from its own folder agents/<agentRunId> (context-file-layout.ts:67 owner.memoryDir; contract L1), so the server answers 404 "File not found." on both commits. Out of this ticket's scope; reported as a follow-up.
